canola - for 1 (flag) soilstress calculation method - 250330 Polkovice EPC DATA Zoli buh LAI konzisztens based on DSSAT, ChatGPT and manual allocation tuning
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FLAGS
0	(flag)		biome type flag (1 = WOODY 0 = NON-WOODY)
0	(flag)		woody type flag (1 = EVERGREEN 0 = DECIDUOUS)
1	(flag)		photosyn. type flag (1 = C3 PSN 0 = C4 PSN)
