STRESS AND SENESCENCE PARAMETERS
0.5		(prop) ROLI OPT VWC ratio to calc. soil moisture limit 1		(prop. to FC-WP)
0.99	(prop)		VWC ratio to calc. soil moisture limit 2 (prop. to SAT-FC)
