1000		(Pa) vapor pressure deficit: start of conductance reduction
2800		(Pa) vapor pressure deficit: complete conductance reduction
0.001    (prop.) 	maximum water stress mortality coefficient of leaf
0.00001   (prop.) 	maximum water stress mortality coefficient of softsem and fine root
0.     (prop.) 	multiplier for water stress mortality calculation of non-structured plant material
31      (Celsius) 	ROLI OPT   lower limit extreme high temperature effect on senescence mortality
40	(Celsius) 	upper limit extreme high temperature effect on senescence mortality
0.00001  (prop.) 	turnover rate of wilted standing biomass to litter
0.05   (prop.) 	turnover rate of non-woody cut-down biomass to litter
0.01    (prop.) 	turnover rate of woody cut-down biomass to litter
30	(nday)		critical value of water stress length leading to excess mortality (see Manual)
0.      (dimless)	effect of soilstress factor on photosynthesis (1: full effect, 0: no effect)
